"""
Second batch of hand transcriptions (2026-11-04) from Porsche Classic colour PDFs
(files.porsche.com, downloaded via the Porsche Classic model pages; not committed).
Same schema as brochure_transcription.py, plus:

scopes : explicit [(scope, model_year)] the entry feeds in pts_dry_run (no file-name
         guessing). A colour listed here is a FACTORY colour for that scope + MY,
         special/extra-cost tiers included — never paint-to-sample.
market : "ROW" (international) or "US" where the brochure says so.

Codes are the paint codes printed on the card (two-character from 1970s on);
"/ V9" Targa roll-bar suffixes etc. are dropped. Names are Porsche's English text
exactly as printed (spelling kept, e.g. "Carmon Red"). Every entry: file + page.
"""

